Replace fabricated Bionic jmp_buf fields with owned AAPCS64 register storage.
Base: asura-wrath-rexglue-sdk 38b40e7424e5d3ce1afa38dca10e9a84b1aa2317.
Public Fiber header/ABI retained; existing array is addressed only as raw bytes.
Explicit context offsets, capacity/alignment assertions and memcpy initialization
avoid private field assumptions, C++ type punning, and object-lifetime changes.
Preserves x19-x30, SP, d8-d15, FPCR/FPSR; Android's x18 is untouched.
BSD-3-Clause source notices/reference commits retained in assembly.

